# Applies to builds whose context is the repository root (apps/studio/Dockerfile).
# apps/api builds from its own folder and has its own .dockerignore.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!apps/studio
!packages/api-client
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/storybook-static
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/tmp
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
